			"notes": "Added Features:\n- Damage Direction Indicator\n  - Displays an arrow around the player's crosshair when they take damage\n  - The indicator points in the direction the damage is coming from, helping the player quickly identify the source of the threat\n  - It is disabled by default, and needs to be enabled via the config\n\nBug fixes:\n- Fixed a crash that happened while walking into an area with an [Easy Mob Farm](https://modrinth.com/mod/easy-mob-farm) farm cube"
		},
